menu "Doom"

    config DOOM_EMBED_WAD
        bool "Embed the WAD from wad/ into the internal storage partition"
        default y
        help
            When wad/doom.wad or wad/doom1.wad exists at configure time, build a FAT
            image of the `storage` partition with it (flashed by idf.py flash and by
            ESP32Watch-Launcher's flash_all.sh) and read it from /internal.
            Disable to always load the WAD from the microSD, even if wad/ has one.
            Run `idf.py reconfigure` after adding or removing a WAD in wad/.

endmenu
